  "storyPlan": {
    "premise": "What can an AI agent actually do? This video is the proof: it was made by an AI agent.\n\nHook: open on the finished video itself (a TikMaker motion video playing full screen) and\nsay this whole video was made by an AI agent from one sentence – then promise to show how.\n\nExplain what an AI agent is and how it differs from a chatbot: a chatbot answers, an agent\ndoes – it uses tools, works in steps and turns one instruction into a finished result.\nUse TikMaker as the real example, with screen recordings: the user types a one-line idea;\nthe agent picks a hook, writes the script and splits it into scenes; it picks the pictures\nand the motion; it generates the voiceover; the final vertical video plays. Show each step\non the real product while the voice explains what the agent is doing.\n\nCTA: comment a topic and the agent will turn it into the next video.vvv"
  },
